# The Wall Panel's spool directory (see avian/api/frame-config.php and
# frame/panel_apply.py). Owner belkins so the daemon may unlink any file in
# it regardless of who wrote it; group caddy with g+w so php-fpm may create
# the request spool. A sticky /tmp forbids exactly that pair — the seam
# review proved it empirically on the live box before this file existed.
# /run is tmpfs: recreated on boot by systemd-tmpfiles, zero SD-card wear.
d /run/birdframe 0775 belkins caddy -
